A||||0||JasonS||Why, oh why did a Neon try me?||||14||
Z||000000||JasonS||10-24-2001||09:20 AM||||Well, I've finished my V8-fiero...ok, it's never finished, but it's drivable!!!  Last week was the first time I took it home from my uncle's shop where I was working on it.  This car is not quiet by no means.  Straight cherry bombs off the headers.  I was sitting idle at a red light admiring the sound of the 540 lift cam and a neon pulls up next to me.  I didn't think nothing of it except it was a 2 lane road merging into one lane up ahead.  I figured the sound of the 350 would scare him off, but no, he wanted a piece of me.  Needless to say, we started off and I took it easy on the gas pedal, you know, I need to break in the motor/clutch/etc.  He slowly started gaining on my side so I had to do it.  I nailed the gas and shifted to third...need I say more.  Why a neon...I was kind of hoping for a mustang or a vette.  Oh well.  I love my fiero.  I just think I'm ruined for life though.  My other '84 4-cyl will never be the same.  Let this be a warning to all....once you go V8, you never go back.<P>later,<BR>Jason||||reg||14
